packages/ltx-core/ is a modified copy of Lightricks' `ltx-core` package
(upstream version 1.1.3). Modified files:

  src/ltx_core/model/transformer/adaln.py
  src/ltx_core/model/transformer/attention.py
  src/ltx_core/model/transformer/modality.py
  src/ltx_core/model/transformer/model.py
  src/ltx_core/model/transformer/transformer.py
  src/ltx_core/model/transformer/transformer_args.py
  src/ltx_core/text_encoders/gemma/embeddings_connector.py
  src/ltx_core/text_encoders/gemma/embeddings_processor.py
  src/ltx_core/text_encoders/gemma/encoders/base_encoder.py

The modifications add in-context auxiliary streams (optical flow, pointmap) with
stage-causal attention, per-stream input/output heads and modality AdaLN, and an
explicit text padding-mask mode.

causalwm/model_loader.py and causalwm/video_utils.py are adapted from
Lightricks' `ltx-trainer` package.

The released CausalWM weights are Derivatives of LTX-2. Gemma-3-12B is used as
the text encoder under the Gemma Terms of Use.
